  "body": "Our vendors have enjoyed this property as a much-loved rental and holiday home, but circumstances have changed—a sale is needed, and they are ready to make it happen.\r\n\r\nTucked away at the end of a peaceful cul-de-sac in sought-after Browns Bay, this tidy 1970s brick-and-tile unit delivers the combination buyers always look for:  sun, privacy, outdoor living and convenience.\r\n\r\nStep inside to find a practical layout with open-plan living, a semi-separate kitchen, and a family bathroom. It's comfortable as is, with plenty of scope to add your own touches over time.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the single garage provides secure parking plus valuable storage.\r\n\r\nOutside, the sunny setting creates a wonderful spot to relax, entertain or simply enjoy the sunshine.\r\n\r\nLocation close to Browns Bay's shops, beach, cafes and amenities, with easy access to public transport and Albany Mall.  Walk to nearby Sherwood Primary and Northcross Intermediate schools.\r\n\r\nCome and see this for yourself.  \r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
